      "writtenOn": "2017-11-27T07:42:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Nit: MAC addresses don\u0027t necessarily identify interfaces - for example virtual MAC addresses are assigned to VRRP groups that can be assigned to more than one interface depending on router failover mechanisms.",
