      "writtenOn": "2017-11-27T14:47:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I would vote for unhiding asap. There are other APIs which are waiting for MacAddress (e.g. Wi-Fi RTT), I\u0027d rather pipeline than block.",
